/Title (ImageWriter II Technical Reference Manual)
/Author (Apple Computer, Inc.)
/Subject (Written and produced by the people at Apple Computer, this manual is the definitive guide to the advanced features of the ImageWriter II printer. If you are an experienced computer user and you want to write your own program to use the Imagewiter II, or if you are running a program that can be configured for a specific printer, this manual is for you.)
/Keywords (ImageWriter, programming, driver, specifications, printer, dot-matrix)
>>
endobj
